## About us
- Acme Corp sells wireless earbuds. Support hours are 9am–6pm, Mon–Fri.
- Returns are free within 30 days, no questions asked.

## Pricing
- Acme Buds: $79. Acme Buds Pro: $129. Shipping is free over $50.

## Troubleshooting
- If the left bud won't pair: put both buds in the case, hold the case
  button for 10 seconds until the light flashes amber, then re-pair.
